; ledger-cli @@ syntax: total price for the whole lot rather than per-unit.
; This is the canonical "Buying foreign currency" example from
; ledger-cli.org/doc — buying 2 BTC for a total of $100000 means the
; unit price is $50000, and our parser must do that division so the
; entry balances correctly.

account Assets:Crypto:BTC
account Assets:Cash

2024-01-15 * Bought 2 BTC at average $50000/each
    Assets:Crypto:BTC          2 BTC @@ $100000.00
    Assets:Cash             -$100000.00
